  "description": "200 years ago, the Great Demon Prelude was sealed by a legendary hero. Now awakened, he seeks out a girl named Freesia—who looks exactly like the hero—and asks her to die. But then he finds out that she's only 20. As his plan to regain his power by eating her, Prelude ends up as her… personal housekeeper?!\n\n(Source: Manta)\n\n*Note: Includes one extra chapter.*",
